        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "#### SUMMARY\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Cash ISAs**: Less valuable for many basic/higher rate taxpayers unless their savings income exceeds the SNRB.  \n",
        "- **Stocks & Shares ISAs**: Valuable for those exceeding the DNRB or making significant capital gains.  \n",
